# 29. Coding-Agent Rules

Give the coding agent these constraints explicitly.

```text
DO NOT redesign unrelated project components.

DO NOT replace deterministic nodes with agent/tool loops.

DO NOT let the LLM execute database mutations.

DO NOT remove confirmation steps.

DO NOT classify expected structured inputs using the LLM.

DO NOT silently discard an active workflow for FAQ questions.

DO NOT preserve flow-specific state when changing workflows.

DO NOT let the LLM generate graph node names.

DO NOT route ambiguous transactional requests automatically.

DO NOT claim an operation succeeded unless the database operation succeeded.

DO preserve the existing frontend API contract unless modification is necessary.

DO preserve existing tests where behaviour remains valid.

DO add tests before deleting legacy routing logic.
```

